#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.rst:2
msgid "fillna"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:1
msgid "Replace NaN and infinity values with specified numbers."
msgstr "NaN および無限大の値を指定した数値に置換します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:3
msgid ""
"This function replaces NaN (Not a Number), positive infinity, and "
"negative infinity values in a tensor with user-specified values. By "
"default, NaN values are replaced with 0, while infinity values are "
"preserved. This behavior differs from ``torch.nan_to_num``, which "
"replaces infinities with the largest/smallest representable finite values"
" by default."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、テンソル内の NaN (Not a Number) "
"値、正の無限大値、負の無限大値をユーザーが指定した値で置換します。デフォルトでは、NaN 値は 0 "
"に置換され、無限大値は保持されます。この動作は、デフォルトで無限大値を表現可能な最大/最小の有限値に置換する「torch.nan_to_num」関数とは異なります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:10
msgid "The input tensor containing values to be replaced."
msgstr "置換対象の値を含む入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:13
msgid "The value to replace NaN with. Default is 0.0."
msgstr "NaN を置き換える値。デフォルトは 0.0 です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:17
msgid ""
"The value to replace positive infinity with. Default is ``math.inf`` "
"(preserves positive infinity)."
msgstr "正の無限大を置き換える値。デフォルトは ``math.inf``\\ （正の無限大を保持します）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:21
msgid ""
"The value to replace negative infinity with. Default is ``-math.inf`` "
"(preserves negative infinity)."
msgstr "負の無限大を置き換える値。デフォルトは ``-math.inf`` で、負の無限大をそのまま保持します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:25
msgid ""
"A new tensor with the same shape and dtype as the input, where NaN and "
"infinity values are replaced according to the specified parameters."
msgstr "入力と同じ形状とデータ型を持つ新しいテンソルで、NaN 値と無限大値は指定されたパラメータに従って置換されます。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:31
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:33
msgid ""
">>> # Replace NaN values with 0 (default behavior)\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, nan])\n"
">>> QF.fillna(x)\n"
"tensor([1., 0., 3., 0.])"
msgstr ">>> # NaN 値を 0 で置換（デフォルトの動作）\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, nan])\n>>> QF.fillna(x)\ntensor([1., 0., 3., 0.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:38
msgid ""
">>> # Replace NaN with -1\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[nan, 2.0], [3.0, nan]])\n"
">>> QF.fillna(x, nan=-1.0)\n"
"tensor([[-1.,  2.],\n"
"        [ 3., -1.]])"
msgstr ">>> # NaN を -1 で置換\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[nan, 2.0], [3.0, nan]])\n>>> QF.fillna(x, nan=-1.0)\ntensor([[-1.,  2.],\n        [ 3., -1.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:44
msgid ""
">>> # Handle infinity values\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, inf, -inf, nan])\n"
">>> QF.fillna(x, nan=0.0, posinf=999.0, neginf=-999.0)\n"
"tensor([   1.,  999., -999.,    0.])"
msgstr ">>> # 無限大値の扱い\n>>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, inf, -inf, nan])\n>>> QF.fillna(x, nan=0.0, posinf=999.0, neginf=-999.0)\ntensor([   1.,  999., -999.,    0.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:49
msgid ""
">>> # Preserve infinity by default\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([inf, -inf, nan])\n"
">>> QF.fillna(x)\n"
"tensor([inf, -inf, 0.])"
msgstr ">>> # デフォルトでは無限大を保持\n>>> x = torch.tensor([inf, -inf, nan])\n>>> QF.fillna(x)\ntensor([inf, -inf, 0.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:54
msgid ":func:`ffill`: Forward fill missing values."
msgstr ":func:`ffill`: 欠損値を前方補完する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:55
msgid ":func:`bfill`: Backward fill missing values."
msgstr ":func:`bfill`: 欠損値を後方補完する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.fillna.fillna:56
msgid "``torch.nan_to_num``: PyTorch's built-in NaN replacement function."
msgstr "``torch.nan_to_num``: PyTorch に組み込まれた NaN 置換関数。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "NOTE: Differently from torch.nan_to_num, this"
#~ " preserves infinity values as is."
#~ msgstr "注意: torch.nan_to_numとは異なり、無限大の値はそのまま保持されます。"

